<title>RUSSIA: Russian weekly inflation unchanged at 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian weekly inflation unchanged at 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian inflation in the week ended September 23 was 0.1 percent, the same as in the previous week, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>If current trends continue, inflation over the whole of September will be 0.3 percent, compared with a price fall of 0.2 percent in August, it said.</p>
<p>Year-on-year inflation in December will be 17.5 percent if current trends continue.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    w/e Sept 23	  w/e Sept 16</p>
<p>    Week-on-week change		+0.1		    +0.1</p>
<p>					  Sept 1-23	    Aug 1-31</p>
<p>    Average daily inflation	  +0.010		  -0.007</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
